      "id": 9983,
      "name": "dedlius",
      "username": "dedlius",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/ccd318/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-27T19:31:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Question for anyone in the know.</p><p>Given the success of the current Kickstarter, it looks like Sentinels Tactics will enjoy a long and fruitful run, much like the card game. Christopher has already mentioned in podcasts and elsewhere that they intend to expand the game through expansions (like Uprising) as well as additional Core Sets.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My question is, is there any sort of timetable for rolling out these core sets? Since this one focused on the Freedom Five, I'm holding out hope that the next one focuses on the Prime Wardens and I am just curious how long we will have to wait between releases.</p>",
