      "created_at": "2014-03-27T20:01:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’d say it would depend on the success of this kickstarter, with enough backs they may be able to put some capital into whatever the next core set is. Otherwise if I had to hazard a guess maybe about a year after the first set’s release.</p>\n<p>Who knows really, I certainly don’t.</p>",
